oes not have relevant callable capabilities for the task, say so briefly and continue with the best fallback.\n</plugins_instructions>"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"019f6a64-61e3-74a3-9767-76ba703c3ef9"}}}
